    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput>MonHashTable</computeroutput> trait for <computeroutput><ref refid="res-monomial-types_8hpp_af33ca331995cea8124ea3653cfbf069d_1af33ca331995cea8124ea3653cfbf069d" kindref="member">res_packed_monomial</ref></computeroutput>s with the component coordinate folded out. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Resolution counterpart of <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomials_ignoring_component" kindref="compound">MonomialsIgnoringComponent</ref></computeroutput>: <computeroutput><ref refid="class_res_monomials_ignoring_component_a0dd8583fdc8322b1d27f464fba0601bb_1a0dd8583fdc8322b1d27f464fba0601bb" kindref="member">hash_value</ref></computeroutput> is just the leading int (the monomial-only hash) and <computeroutput><ref refid="class_res_monomials_ignoring_component_af74bbf6071b0241af0f2ae508e905cec_1af74bbf6071b0241af0f2ae508e905cec" kindref="member">is_equal</ref></computeroutput> defers to <computeroutput><ref refid="class_res_monoid_dense_a08f4b8038adfbed311a1019b06a1686f_1a08f4b8038adfbed311a1019b06a1686f" kindref="member">ResMonoid::monomial_part_is_equal</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
